{'symbol': 'SYY', 'date': '2021-12-17 18:00:00', 'title': 'SYSCO ANNOUNCES ELECTION OF THREE NEW DIRECTORS', 'text': "HOUSTON, DEC. 17, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- SYSCO CORPORATION (NYSE: SYY), THE LEADING GLOBAL FOODSERVICE DISTRIBUTION COMPANY, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THREE NEW DIRECTORS, ALI DIBADJ, JILL M. GOLDER AND ALISON KENNEY PAUL, WILL JOIN THE COMPANY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS EFFECTIVE JAN. 1, 2022, EXPANDING THE SIZE OF THE BOARD TO 13 MEMBERS. THESE NEW DIRECTORS WERE APPOINTED IN CONNECTION WITH THE BOARD'S ONGOING REFRESHMENT EFFORTS, AND WILL STAND FOR REELECTION AT SYSCO'S NEXT ANNUAL MEETING OF STOCKHOLDERS ON NOV. 18, 2022."}